Now your time is running out.

You have other places to visit
He spent so much time on making them,
And thought It would be a waste to not show anyone.

You're his victim.
You have no choice.

That was the theme
The choice.

The inability to make a choice.
If choosing is no different from not choosing.
What is free will?
What can you really choose?

+ [We are what we choose]
Yet what can you really choose?
He could not choose the theme of his own game
He could not choose the trajectory of his own life

And yet he lives.
-> Reflection

